// iOS push notifications. Apple only allows them for apps signed by a paid
// Apple Developer Program team, so they are off by default.
//
// To turn them on (once the APNs key is uploaded to Firebase project
// elbench-624b9 and ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist is in place):
//   ELBENCH_PUSH = Push
// This signs the app with the aps-environment entitlement and tells the app
// to register for notifications.
ELBENCH_PUSH =
